        "cooked": "<p>Advanced Apostate vs. Prime Wardens Fanatic, Chrono-Ranger, The Naturalist, and Prime Wardens Haka in Atlantis.</p>\n<p>I had a pretty quick and easy fight with this one - done on Chrono-Ranger's fourth turn, and I made a silly play&nbsp;with Fanatic early in the game. It ended up not mattering much, as I had plenty of damage and destruction to deal with everything that showed up.</p>\n<p>Final HP 7 - 16 - 12 - 17</p>",
