        "id": 226013,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-19T12:38:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I kept waiting for something really bad to go down, but by the time I hit multiple Leaking Rooms in a row, it didn't matter if I could play cards. Easy Mint.</p>\n<p>My only advice is go crazy with Divine Focus once you have an opening. By the time I got it out, Apostate was nearly dead, and the environment ended up taking his last few HP because I was off by&nbsp;<em>just</em> that much. :)</p>",
