        "created_at": "2019-03-20T11:00:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fairly simple here, too. Not quite as fast as round 4, but I had Chrono-Ranger pull his damage reduction gun early in the fight to reduce damage. After that, it was really on cruise control as there is nothing in the environment or Apostate's deck that could come close to providing a threat or disrupting the board.</p>\n<p>I do need to remember not to play Undaunted and then use Sacrosanct Martyr at the same time, though. :(</p>",
